DTSTART:20250212T000000
DTEND:20271108T000000
DTSTAMP:20260923T155014Z
UID:36dbe7fe65160aa7abfa9b89814f16@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A very special new addition is on view in our Monet Gallery: W
 ater Lilies\, Reflections of Weeping Willows (about 1916–19) is a large-
 scale work of the style that defined the last years of Monet’s career. O
 n loan from a private collection\, the painting features a deep jewel-tone
 d color palette and captures the expressive power of the artist’s increa
 singly abstract later work. Don’t miss your chance to see it in a fully 
 reimagined gallery display.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://w
 ww.meetboston.com/event/monets-water-lilies-reflections-of-weeping-willows
 /84445/
LOCATION:Museum of Fine Arts\, Boston\, 465 Huntington Avenue\, Boston\, M
 A\, 02115
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/monets-water-lilies-reflections-of-we
 eping-willows/84445/
END:VEVENT
