DTSTAMP:20260923T155014Z
UID:e73840df6664917d309bc5bdd490e2@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Let our costumed guides transport you back in time to 1775 as 
 they share the events that occurred on this hallowed ground over 240 years
  ago\, at the very start of the American Revolution. Discover the everyday
  people – the original patriots - who stood up for what they believed in
 \, and helped shaped the future of the United States. This spring\, one-ho
 ur guided walking tours of Lexington Battle Green are available on Fridays
 \, Saturdays\, and Sundays. Walk in\, or book online. Private tours of the
  Battle Green and surrounding area are also available. Contact us at 781-6
 98-4568 to arrange a one-of-kind experience today! Our tours begin at the 
 Lexington Visitors Center\, across from the iconic statue of Captain John 
 Parker at 1875 Massachusetts Avenue in Lexington.\n\nSources: Meet Boston
