BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Artist / Maker Nights with QWAC
DTSTART:20260507T000000
DTEND:20260507T020000
DTSTAMP:20260923T155014Z
UID:0bbd578aefa310f9c7cb916039ca6a@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're an artist\, or a beginner who wants to explore 
