DESCRIPTION:Wings & Tides Bird Club Starting May 7\, the newly formed Wing
 s & Tides Bird Club will meet at the library on the first Thursday of the 
 month at 6:00 p.m. Time may adjust slightly with the seasons and setting s
 un. This club will meet until winter when southern migration starts in ear
 nest. We’ll meet and mingle in the community room\, share sightings\, ph
 otos\, successful locations and tips followed by a group migration to the 
 garden for a group sit and observation. Bringing along a portable chair is
  encouraged (available outdoor seating is limited) and your favorite binoc
 ulars. Since we will be meeting inside first\, you’re welcome to leave y
 our chair on the back patio while we gather inside. If you would like to l
 ead a group field trip or educational lecture\, please reach out to Becky 
 at becky@westfalmouthlibrary.org Register HERE.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamb
