 11\, 2026 🕚 11:00 AM – 3:00 PM 📍 The Village Green at Mashpee Comm
 ons\, 4 Job's Fishing Road\, Mashpee\, MA 02649 Spend your Sundays at the 
 award-winning Mashpee Farmers Market\, where community\, local food\, and 
 Cape Cod creativity come together. Hosted by the Mashpee Chamber of Commer
 ce\, the market features an incredible mix of local farms\, food producers
