DTEND:20260709T020000
DTSTAMP:20260923T155014Z
UID:921f2f2e0fa20ffc857765e7c01125@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Dumplings to Dim Sum takes you beyond the gateway and into the
  heart of one of Boston's most vibrant neighborhoods. Discover the rich hi
 story\, culture\, and incredible flavors of Chinatown as you visit beloved
  family-run restaurants and hidden local gems. Savor generous tastings of 
 handmade dumplings\, flaky pastries\, and authentic regional Chinese speci
 alties while learning how generations of immigrants built and preserved th
 is thriving community. Along the way\, your local guide shares stories of 
 resilience\, tradition\, and the people behind the neighborhood's most bel
 oved eateries. Enjoy small groups (maximum 12 guests)\, a relaxed walking 
 pace\, and plenty of insider recommendations to help you continue explorin
 g Chinatown long after the tour ends. Come hungry—you'll leave with a de
 eper appreciation for Boston's Chinatown and the unforgettable flavors tha
 t make it one of the city's best-kept culinary treasures. MORE INFO/ BUY T
 ICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/eve
 nt/dumplings-to-dim-sum/91660/
