BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New Perspectives: Paintings by Deena Gu presented by Highfield Hal
 l & Gardens
DTSTART:20260730T000000
DTEND:20261025T000000
DTSTAMP:20260923T155014Z
UID:1306d55acf0a728a9f3c8844455cfa@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Deena Gu Laties returns to Highfield Hall & Gardens during the
  summer of 2026 for her third exhibition\, The exhibit will feature new wo
 rk by Gu in addition to examples of her work representing her early traini
 ng in classical Chinese calligraphy. Deena is an accomplished artist who m
 elds aspects of western art with her Chinese training. Born in Shanghai\, 
 Deena Gu studied under famous Chinese painters Cheng Shifa and Tse Chen-Na
 . She continued her art studies at the Pennsylvania Academy of Fine Arts w
 hen she moved to the U.S. in the 1980s\, fusing Chinese tradition with a w
 estern approach in terms of space\, color and relationship. Deena has crea
 ted new work for the Highfield Hall exhibit. The late renowned Philadelphi
 a artist\, Sam Maitin said\, “In painting watercolor on silk\, I find th
 at her command of the medium is extensive and eloquent. It has an imperial
 \, regal quality. She handles it so deftly and so expertly.” Deena Gu’
 s preferred painting medium is watercolor on silk. Silk is a traditional C
 hinese medium. Deena feels that the smoothness of silk exhibits the most e
 xquisite colors. She also paints on rice paper as well as oils on canvas. 
 “When I paint on silk\, I feel a strong communication with its texture. 
 Silk is like a part of me\,” says Deena\, whose subjects include landsca
 pes\, flowers – especially lotus blossoms – birds\, as well as portrai
 ts. Gallery Hours: Tues-Fri 10-4\; Sat-Sun 10-2\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamb
 er\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/new-perspectives%3a-p
 aintings-by-deena-gu-presented-by-highfield-hall-%26-gardens/52060/
LOCATION:Highfield Hall & Gardens\, 56 Shady Lane\, E. Falmouth\, MA\, 025
 36
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/new-perspectives%3a-paintings-by-
 deena-gu-presented-by-highfield-hall-%26-gardens/52060/
END:VEVENT
