 rom throughout the Greater Boston area along with a different theme each m
 onth: May 24 (Rhythm and Blooms)\, June 28 (The Cookout)\, July 26 (Fun in
  the Sun)\, August 23 (Art & Soul)\, September 27 (Rooted in Wellness) and
  October 25 (Fall Fest). The market is open from 12:00pm to 6:00pm at Harb
 or Way (111 Autumn Lane) and is free to the public. Each month\, special t
 hemed activities will vary as well\, including a family-friendly Tot Spot 
 Playspace\, food from rotating vendors\, live music by DJ Slick Vick\, DJ 
 Mez & KNSZWRTH\, photobooth coordinated by Snapped\, along with entertainm
 ent and giveaways unifying the theme. LEARN MORE\n\nSources: Meet Boston\n
