  Salem. Moviemakers love our dramatic architecture\, picturesque waterfron
 t and historic streets. Join this fabulous tour that was written by someon
 e who ACTUALLY works in the TV & Movie industry that has exclusive informa
 tion. And you may be lucky enough to be led by the only guide in Salem who
  was ACTUALLY in Hocus Pocus 2. Salem is a 30-minute ride from Boston on t
 he Newburyport/Rockport train from North Station (where the Bruins and Cel
 tics play). There are late trains back to Boston after the tour. Come up f
 or the day and take a morning ferry to Salem and then the train back at ni
 ght Our walking tours give you a wonderful perspective of our quaint city.
  We bring you throughout the downtown area as well as the McIntire Distric
 t. TOURS RUN RAIN OR SHINE. NO REFUNDS. We do not go inside any buildings
 \, dogs are allowed on our tours\, with the exception of the cemetery and 
 access to tour locations is subject to city regulations. A confirmation an
 d details on meeting location in Salem will be sent to you via email immed
 iately after booking. CLICK HERE TO PURCHASE TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Bost
 on\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/hocus-pocus-movies-%26-mo
 re-tour/90228/
