SUMMARY:The Norwegians
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260904
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260905
DTSTAMP:20260923T155014Z
UID:8a8e8d5fb6c39f7461b162b59a06b5@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Set in a Minnesota bar where heartbreak is served alongside be
 er\, The Norwegians is a sharp\, surprising dark comedy about love gone wr
 ong—and the lengths we go to set things right. Betty and Olive\, two wom
 en reeling from romantic betrayal\, hatch an unlikely plan: hiring a pair 
 of Norwegian hitmen to deal with the men who wronged them.\n\nSources: The
  Berkshires\nEvent page: https://berkshires.org/events-old/the-norwegians/
LOCATION:Shakespeare &#038\; Company\, 70 Kemble Street\, Lenox\, MA\, 012
 40
URL:https://berkshires.org/events-old/the-norwegians/
END:VEVENT
