DESCRIPTION:King Richard’s Faire is New England’s largest and longest-
 running Renaissance festival\, now hosted at Edaville Entertainment in Car
 ver\, Massachusetts. Step into a lively 16th-century village filled with k
 nights\, royalty\, artisans\, and unforgettable entertainment. The 2026 se
 ason begins with a special three-day opening weekend from September 5–7 
 and continues every Saturday and Sunday through October 25. Guests can als
 o enjoy a special three-day holiday weekend October 10–12. Throughout th
 e season\, visitors can experience thrilling jousting tournaments\, live c
 omedy\, music\, acrobatics\, artisan shopping\, themed food and beverages
 \, and interactive entertainment for all ages. Whether you're cheering on 
 your favorite knight\, exploring the artisan marketplace\, or creating las
 ting family memories\, King Richard’s Faire offers a one-of-a-kind escap
 e into a world of history\, fantasy\, and adventure.\n\nSources: Meet Bost
 on\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/king-richards-faire/91044
 /
LOCATION:Edaville Entertainment Venue\, 5 Pine Street\, Carver\, MA\, 0233
 0
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/king-richards-faire/91044/
END:VEVENT
