UID:e414587160d9e1f1217fb75ab22665@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Step into the realm of knowledge and entertainment at our new 
 FREE trivia nights hosted by The Entertainment Nation! Join us every Thurs
 day from 6pm to 8pm for an evening of brain-teasing questions\, friendly c
 ompetition\, and loads of fun. Located in CanalSide Food + Drink. Gather y
 our friends\, family\, or colleagues and put your thinking caps on as you 
 form teams to tackle an array of diverse trivia categories. From history a
