BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:UB40
DTSTART:20260923T000000
DTEND:20260923T000000
DTSTAMP:20260923T155014Z
UID:29d34eabdcb87d4c0d8179b6091736@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:UB40 is one of the most successful and influential British gro
 ups of all time\, with more than 100 million albums sold\, and more than 5
 0 charting singles in the UK\, including their trademark global #1 hits 
 “Red Red Wine” and “(I Can’t Help) Falling in Love With You”\; a
 nd U.S. Top 10s “Here I Am(Come and Take Me)” and “The Way You Do Th
 e Things You Do.” The reggae/pop legends set the stage this fall for the
 ir highly anticipated Relentless tour\, performing their iconic hit songs
 \, along with new songs and reworked classics from their recently released
