 ir signature explosive live performances across headline slots at festival
 s including Reading & Leeds\, Isle of Wight and many more as well as their
  own UK & European headline arena tours. As they prepare for their 2025 fe
 stival run\, The Prodigy are also hard at work in the studio\, crafting ne
 w material to follow up their critically acclaimed album No Tourists\, whi
 ch solidified their record-breaking streak of seven consecutive UK No. 1 a
 lbums\, dating back to 1997’s Music For The Jilted Generation.\n\nSource
