 ve deep into the secrets of harnessing your inner power\, embracing your t
 rue presence\, and discovering lasting peace. This is your chance to conne
 ct\, reflect\, and recharge in a warm\, inspiring atmosphere. Don't miss o
 ut on this unique experience to grow and unwind with Gurudev! LEARN MORE /
