DESCRIPTION:This fun and relaxing art class invites participants to create
  a vibrant Cape Cod sunset painting\, even if they’ve never painted befo
 re. Step by step\, students will learn how to use acrylic paint to capture
  the warmth\, movement\, and color of our local natural beauty. This class
  will cover: -Basic composition and layout -Acrylic painting techniques (b
 lending\, layering\, brushwork) -How to choose and harmonize colors -Captu
 ring the feel of nature through light and form By the end of the session\,
  everyone will complete and take home their own finished canvas. Participa
 nts should bring: -1 canvas or canvas panel (approx. 12”x16”or similar
 ) -Apron or old shirt to protect clothing (Age 18+\, Beginners/No experien
 ce needed)\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodch
 amber.org/event/painting-a-cape-cod-sunset/52437/
