DTSTART:20260925T193000
DTEND:20260925T213000
DTSTAMP:20260923T155014Z
UID:8dd25ab7e7628e1fd841e170f32cee@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A portion of the proceeds will support The Jake Galliher Found
 ation. Rev Tor returns to The Colonial stage to celebrate 30 years! Since 
 1996\, Rev Tor has been a consistent presence on the East Coast club and f
 estival circuit\, performing from Maine to Key West. Tor and his band have
  shared the stage with members of The Grateful Dead\, Dead & Co.\, Phish\,
  The Allman Brothers Band and New Riders of the Purple Sage. Over his 30+ 
 year career\, he has also appeared at festivals and concerts alongside art
 ists such as Leon Russell\, Los Lobos\, String Cheese Incident and many ot
 hers. Along the way\, Rev Tor became known not only for his technical skil
 l and soulful playing\, but for his collaborative spirit. Rev Tor 30th Ann
 iversary Jam will feature many special guests and surprises throughout the
  night\, including former members and some special musical friends. An upd
 ated lineup of guests will be announced soon.\n\nSources: The Berkshires\n
 Event page: https://berkshires.org/events-old/rev-tors-30th-anniversary-ja
 m/
