 ks\, comic art\, oddities and action figures from independent New England 
 sellers. September 26–27\, 2026\, Saturday and Sunday\, 10:00 AM–4:00 
 PM at Boxboro Regency in Boxborough\, MA. Children 10 and under are admitt
 ed free with an adult purchase\, and parking is free. General admission is
