 ket! See below for full schedule. 🦖 Saturday is Dino Jungle Day - Get u
 p close and personal with some scaly creatures. 👸🏽 Sunday is Princes
 s & Pirate Day - Come dressed in your best costume and get ready for some 
 magic. 🎸 Sunday Only - See your fellow kids rock out with a full live c
 oncert performed School of Rock Northborough all throughout the day. 🦊 
 Children under 5 are free! A weekend of fun for the whole family. 🍔 Fan
 tastic food including a special themed menu at the Wachusett Children's Fo
 od Tent. 🛍️ Local Crafters Market selling handmade plushies\, sweet t
 reats\, and more. 🍂 Our scenic Skyride is the best view on the mountain
