DESCRIPTION:Join thousands of participants on Sunday\, Sept. 27\, at Polar
  Park for the 28th annual UMass Cancer Walk! The superhero-themed event ce
 lebrates patients\, family members\, researchers\, healthcare providers\, 
 sponsors\, volunteers—and you. By raising money and walking with us\, yo
 u have the “power” to make a real difference for those facing cancer. 
 Participants are encouraged to dress as superheroes\, and special superher
 o guests will make appearances throughout the day. Funds raised support th
 e researchers and physician-scientists at UMass Chan Medical School who ar
 e working to make new discoveries and bring innovative therapies to patien
 ts. Be a superhero for cancer research! Register as an individual\, start 
 a team or make a donation today. Registration is $20 for participants age 
 13 and older. Children 12 and younger may register free of charge. Online 
 registration closes at noon on Thursday\, Sept. 24. Day-of registration is
  $25 for participants age 13 and older.\n\nSources: Discover Central Massa
 chusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/umass-cancer
 -walk/30735/
