DTEND:20261104T000000
DTSTAMP:20260923T155014Z
UID:12abc19da5042b3771633e463e8ace@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Wednesdays at 4:30pm September 30th - November 4 Participants 
 can register on September 30th - 6 classes for $60. Walk-ins are welcome f
 or $15. Living in harmony with seasonal changes is a pillar of Qigong. The
  warmth of late summer has ended leaving the Earth element behind and move
 s into fall\, the Metal element\, which is associated with the Lungs. Fall
  is an opportunity to turn inward\, release and reflect. With gentle breat
 hwork and movements\, we will activate our Qi (life-force energy) to bring
  physical and emotional ease into our lives. Free class at Bourne Library 
 at 10am on October 1st.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://
