DESCRIPTION:Newburyport Art (NAA): see what’s happening at 65 Water Stre
 et in September. It’s the month to start learning more! Details and regi
 strations are found at Newburyportart.org/classes-and-workshops Art Market
  behind 65 Water Street\, Sunday\, September 13th\, 11am-3pm Join NAA memb
