BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Giocosa Chamber Music presents Nevermore
DTSTART:20261003T000000
DTEND:20261003T000000
DTSTAMP:20260923T155014Z
UID:5f875b9e8e5d3cb5284e51c429542c@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:We're kicking off the season on the dark(er) side. A little my
 sterious music\, a little Edgar Allan Poe\, an innocent maiden visited by 
 the specter of death...you know...just a normal Saturday night. Giocosa Ch
 amber Music’s first concert of the season features string quartets by Ce
 cilia Muylaert\, Evan Blaché\, Shostakovich and Beethoven in a unique pre
 sentation of Poe’s The Raven\, plus Franz Schubert’s iconic Death and 
 the Maiden. A classical concert gets no spookier.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Cha
 mber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/giocosa-chamber-mus
 ic-presents-nevermore/52345/
LOCATION:Meetinghouse at the Orleans Historical Society\, 3 River Rd\, Orl
 eans\, MA
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/giocosa-chamber-music-presents-ne
 vermore/52345/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Halloween on the Hill
DTSTART:20261003T173000
DTEND:20261003T203000
