DESCRIPTION:Music by Giuseppe Verdi | Libretto by Francesco Maria Piave an
 d Andrea Maffei Two of opera’s most extraordinary artists return to The 
 Met: Live in HD for Verdi’s thrilling take on the immortal Shakespearean
  tale of the scheming couple determined to seize power at any cost. Barito
 ne Quinn Kelsey is the Scottish king haunted by the ghosts of his murderou
 s ascent to the throne\, opposite soprano Lise Davidsen as the power-mad L
 ady Macbeth\, whose ruinous ambition damns them both. Met Music Director Y
 annick Nézet-Séguin takes the podium for a penetrating production by Lou
 isa Proske. Rounding out the all-star cast are tenor Freddie De Tommaso as
  Macduff and bass-baritone Ryan Speedo Green as Banquo. Conductor: Yannick
  Nézet-Séguin Production: Louisa Proske Lady Macbeth: Lise Davidsen Set 
 Designer: Jon Bausor Macduff: Freddie De Tommaso Costume Designer: Montana
  Levi Blanco Macbeth: Quinn Kelsey Lighting Designer: Adam Silverman Banqu
 o: Ryan Speedo Green Choreographer: Jorrell Lawyer-Jefferson Action Direct
 or: Ran Arthur Braun C. Graham Berwind\, III Chorus Director: Tilman Micha
 el\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/even
 t/macbeth-2/
